{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cgsdata\/cgs\/data\/content\/downloadedissues()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData","doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS","doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS\/Data","doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS\/Data\/Content"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"downloadedIssues","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO7ContentO6Issuesa","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS\/Data\/Content\/Issues","text":"Issues","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reads the device, never the network: every issue it lists is on disk by definition, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"library built on it opens in a tunnel. The metadata comes from the file each download folder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already carries — written when the package was resolved, so the reader could draw its header","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"offline — which is why this takes no identifiers and fetches nothing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Scoped to the profile that owns the download, not to the account. Bytes are shared between"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"profiles that downloaded the same issue, but ownership is recorded per profile, and this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"follows the active one: switching profile rebuilds the provider and the list with it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It also reloads itself. A download finishing or being deleted changes what the library holds","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without anyone calling ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"load()"},{"type":"text","text":", so those two are watched here rather than left to the host —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is what lets a page bind to this and be done."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A download whose metadata file is missing is left out. The file is written best-effort, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing else on disk names the issue, so a row the page could not label is a row it cannot","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"draw. Downloading the issue again writes it.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"downloadedIssues","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO7ContentO6Issuesa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Issues"}],"externalID":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO7ContentO16downloadedIssuesAG19PaginatedDependencyCy___AE5IssueO5ShortVGyFZ","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","title":"downloadedIssues()","extendedModule":"CGSData","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"CGSData"}]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a provider for the issues the active profile has finished downloading, most recently","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"downloaded first."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS\/Data\/Content\/downloadedIssues()"},"references":{"doc://co.cafeyn.CGSData/documentation/CGSData":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"CGSData","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/cgsdata"},"doc://co.cafeyn.CGSData/documentation/CGSData/CGS/Data":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Data","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS\/Data","url":"\/documentation\/cgsdata\/cgs\/data","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Data"}],"role":"symbol","title":"CGS.Data","abstract":[{"text":"Namespace for the SDK’s data layer public API (V1+).","type":"text"}]},"doc://co.cafeyn.CGSData/documentation/CGSData/CGS/Data/Content/downloadedIssues()":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS\/Data\/Content\/downloadedIssues()","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cgsdata\/cgs\/data\/content\/downloadedissues()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"downloadedIssues"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO4DataO7ContentO6Issuesa","text":"Issues"}],"role":"symbol","title":"downloadedIssues()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a provider for the issues the active profile has finished downloading, most recently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"downloaded first.","type":"text"}]},"doc://co.cafeyn.CGSData/documentation/CGSData/CGS":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CGS","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cgsdata\/cgs","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Entry point of the SDK, to be extended by Cafeyn target."}],"title":"CGS","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CGS","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://co.cafeyn.CGSData/documentation/CGSData/CGS/Data/Content":{"url":"\/documentation\/cgsdata\/cgs\/data\/content","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Content","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"CGS.Data.Content","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Catalog of content available to the current profile.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS\/Data\/Content"},"doc://co.cafeyn.CGSData/documentation/CGSData/CGS/Data/Content/Issues":{"url":"\/documentation\/cgsdata\/cgs\/data\/content\/issues","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Issues","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Issues","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"CGS.Data.Content.Issues","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Paginated archive of issues for a set of publications, most recent first.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.cafeyn.CGSData\/documentation\/CGSData\/CGS\/Data\/Content\/Issues"}}}